}⟨2{e}^{2t},1,0⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that $T$ denotes the unit tangent vector." 13194139535879 true] [17592186372077 1113 #uuid "780d7d73-3673-560c-aa7d-955afb9a9935" 13194139535879 true] [17592186372077 1145 "The binormal vector is given by\n\n$$\nB(t)=T(t)\\times N(t),\n$$\n\nwhere the principal normal vector $N(t)$ is given by\n\n$$\nN(t)=\\frac{{T}^{′}(t)}{‖{T}^{′}(t)‖}.\n$$\n\nFirst, we find the principal normal $N(t).$ To do this, we calculate ${T}^{′}(t)$ and its magnitude as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{T}^{′}(t) & =⟨\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{2{e}^{2t}}{\\sqrt{4{e}^{4t}+1}}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4{e}^{4t}+1}}),\\,\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}t}(0)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{4{e}^{2t}}{(4{e}^{4t}+1)^{3/2}},\\,-\\frac{8{e}^{4t}}{(4{e}^{4t}+1)^{3/2}},\\,0⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{4{e}^{2t}}{(4{e}^{4t}+1)^{3/2}}⟨1,\\,-2{e}^{2t},\\,0⟩ \\\\ ‖{T}^{′}(t)‖ & =\\frac{4{e}^{2t}}{(4{e}^{4t}+1)^{3/2}}\\sqrt{(1)^{2}+{(-2{e}^{2t})}^{2}+{(0)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{4{e}^{2t}}{(4{e}^{4t}+1)^{3/2}}\\sqrt{4{e}^{4t}+1} \\\\  & =\\frac{4{e}^{2t}}{4{e}^{4t}+1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we normalize ${T}^{′}(t)$ and obtain the principal normal to the curve:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}N(t) & =\\frac{{T}^{′}(t)}{‖{T}^{′}(t)‖}=\\frac{\\frac{4{e}^{2t}}{(4{e}^{4t}+1)^{3/2}}⟨1,-2{e}^{2t},0⟩}{(\\frac{4{e}^{2t}}{4{e}^{4t}+1})}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4{e}^{4t}+1}}⟨1,\\,-2{e}^{2t},\\,0⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we calculate the binormal vector, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}B(t) & =T(t)\\times N(t) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4{e}^{4t}+1}}⟨2{e}^{2t},1,0⟩\\times \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{4{e}^{4t}+1}}⟨1,\\,-2{e}^{2t},\\,0⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4{e}^{4t}+1}\\,\\left|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 2{e}^{2t} & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -2{e}^{2t} & 0\\end{aligned}\\right| \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4{e}^{4t}+1}[\\text{ }\\left|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ -2{e}^{2t} & 0\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,i-\\left|\\begin{aligned}2{e}^{2t} & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,j+\\left|\\begin{aligned}2{e}^{2t} & 1 \\\\ 1 & -2{e}^{2t}\\end{aligned}\\right|\\,k\\text{ }] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4{e}^{4t}+1}⟨0+0,-(0-0),-4{e}^{4t}-1⟩ \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{4{e}^{4t}+1}⟨0,0,-(4{e}^{4t}+1)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,0,\\,-1⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535879 true] [17592186372078 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372079 13194139535879 true] [17592186372078 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372080 13194139535879 true] [17592186372078 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372081 13194139535879 true] [17592186372078 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372082 13194139535879 true] [17592186372078 1000 #edb/ref 17592186372083 13194139535879 true] [17592186372078 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535879 true] [17592186372078 1041 "selection" 13194139535879 true] [17592186372078 1104 #edb/ref 17592186372082 13194139535879 true] [17592186372078 1110 #uuid "e2663263-0ee6-5e60-b6b3-d27a774b454b" 13194139535879 true] [17592186372079 1034 "⟨0,\\,1,\\,0⟩" 13194139535879 true] [17592186372079 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535879 true] [17592186372079 1111 #uuid "10a09701-fbc0-531a-b9b6-cbe979759d09" 13194139535879 true] [17592186372080 1034 "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}⟨1,\\,1,\\,0⟩" 13194139535879 true] [17592186372080 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535879 true] [17592186372080 1111 #uuid "48af7b6a-f57b-5bd2-be7d-fd4b26b6bb86" 13194139535879 true] [17592186372081 1034 "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}⟨1,\\,0,\\,-1⟩" 13194139535879 true] [17592186372081 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535879 true] [17592186372081 1111 #uuid "3a812dbd-c7be-50a6-b715-546dd1cf91b4" 13194139535879 true] [17592186372082 1034 "⟨0,\\,0,\\,-1⟩" 13194139535879 true] [17592186372082 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535879 true] [17592186372082 1111 #uuid "35b999fb-8ef9-581e-9f5f-9b833658a4b9" 13194139535879 true] [17592186372083 1034 "⟨-1,\\,0,\\,0⟩" 13194139535879 true] [17592186372083 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535879 true] [17592186372083 1111 #uuid "c3c1e693-a8d6-5651-ab56-de4383395389" 13194139535879 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-127613" 17592186372007 "q-127613/selection" 1